---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LegalHeader from '../components/LegalHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Yahor Darashkevich"
  description="Privacy Policy for Yahor Darashkevich portfolio website."
>
  <LegalHeader />
  <main class="py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl border p-8 md:p-12" style="background-color: var(--color-surface); border-color: var(--color-border); box-shadow: 0 16px 38px var(--color-shadow);">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-4 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-soft)] mb-10">Effective date: July 14, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
              This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and protected when you visit this
              website or contact Yahor Darashkevich through the website.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">2. Data Controller</h2>
            <p>
              The data controller for this website is Yahor Darashkevich.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Controller: Yahor Darashkevich</li>
              <li>Email: <a class="text-[var(--color-primary)] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--color-icon)]" href="mailto:yahor@darashkevich.com">yahor@darashkevich.com</a></li>
              <li>Location: Remote · U.S. & EU work-authorized</li>
              <li>Business correspondence address: available upon written request</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">3. Information Collected</h2>
            <p>Information that may be collected includes:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Contact details you provide (such as name, email, phone, company, and message content).</li>
              <li>Technical data (such as browser type, device information, IP address, and pages visited).</li>
              <li>Scheduling details provided through linked booking tools.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">4. How Information Is Used</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
              <li>To respond to inquiries and provide requested services.</li>
              <li>To schedule consultations and communicate about projects.</li>
              <li>To improve website functionality and user experience.</li>
              <li>To comply with legal obligations and protect rights.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">5. Legal Bases for Processing</h2>
            <p>Where applicable, information is processed on one or more of the following bases:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Your consent.</li>
              <li>Performance of a contract or pre-contractual steps.</li>
              <li>Legitimate business interests.</li>
              <li>Compliance with legal obligations.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">6. Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>
              Data may be shared with trusted service providers used to operate the website and communications
              (for example, hosting and scheduling providers). Data is not sold.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">7. International Data Transfers</h2>
            <p>
              If personal data is transferred outside your jurisdiction (including outside the EEA/UK where
              applicable), appropriate safeguards are used, such as Standard Contractual Clauses or equivalent
              transfer mechanisms required by law.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">8. Data Retention</h2>
            <p>
              Information is retained only as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy,
              or as required by law.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">9. Security</h2>
            <p>
              Reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards are used to protect information.
              However, no method of transmission or storage is guaranteed to be completely secure.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">10. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
            <p>
              This website does not use non-essential analytics or advertising cookies. Only strictly necessary
              technical cookies that may be set by hosting infrastructure are used for core website functionality.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              When enabled, privacy-friendly web analytics may be collected via Cloudflare Web Analytics. This uses a
              lightweight JavaScript beacon and does not set cookies. It provides aggregated, anonymized usage metrics
              (such as page views and basic performance data). Personal advertising profiles are not created.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">11. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>
              Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict the processing
              of your data, and to object to processing or request portability.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              To exercise these rights, email
              <a class="text-[var(--color-primary)] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--color-icon)] ml-1" href="mailto:yahor@darashkevich.com">yahor@darashkevich.com</a>.
              Identity verification may be required. Requests are typically answered within 30 days where required by law.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              You may also have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection supervisory authority.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">12. Third-Party Links</h2>
            <p>
              This website may contain links to third-party services. Their privacy practices are governed by their
              own policies.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">13. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
              This policy may be updated periodically. The updated version will be posted on this page with a revised
              effective date.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">14. Contact</h2>
            <p>
              For privacy-related questions, contact:
              <a class="text-[var(--color-primary)] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--color-icon)] ml-1" href="mailto:yahor@darashkevich.com">
                yahor@darashkevich.com
              </a>
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
